<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xmlns:cbml="http://www.cbml.org/ns/1.0">
    <teiHeader>
        <fileDesc>
            <titleStmt>
                <title>A Visual History</title>
                <author>Valve Corporation</author>
                <author>Michael Oeming</author> 
                <!--Was unable to find who specifically wrote this comic. Oeming was the artist, unsure if there's a tag specifically showing that.-->
            </titleStmt>
            <publicationStmt>
                <p>By Valve Corporation. Published June  10th, 2010.</p>
            </publicationStmt>
            <sourceDesc>
                <p>Born digital: no previous source exists.</p>
            </sourceDesc>
        </fileDesc>
    </teiHeader>
<text>
    <body>
        <div type="page" n="1">
            <note type="pageDesc">
                
            </note>
            <cbml:panel n="1" characters="Scout Soldier Heavy">
                <cbml:caption type="heading">
                    Dustbowl. Yesterday.
                </cbml:caption>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Heavy">
                    <l>I cannot believe our guns break in middle of battle.<emph rendition="b">Again.</emph></l>
                </cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">
                    <l>In <emph rendition="b i">America, </emph><emph rendition="i">comrade, </emph>we do not blame the tool. We blame the <emph rendition="b i">man.</emph></l>
                </cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">I blame a <emph rendition="i">Mann </emph>alright. Mann Co. This stuff is <emph rendition="b i">junk!</emph></cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="2" characters="Scout">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">Seriously, <emph rendition="b i">look </emph>at this! My earpiece melted inside my <emph rendition="b i">skull </emph> here!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">That's like three times now!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="3" characters="Heavy Soldier Scout">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Ladies, clearly I cannot talk to you as I wouold with men.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">So I will sugarcoat this with your fancy college talk.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Either we find a just-in-time solution to resynergize our paradigm, or we will be thinking <emph rendition="b i">inside </emph>the box.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Six feet under the ground.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">Holy crap! Hey, fellas, look at this!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="4">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Was... was that there yesterday?</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Heavy">Is so <emph rendition="b i">white...</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">It looks like some kinda hospital for fruit.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
        </div>
        
        <div type="page" n="2">            
            <cbml:panel n="1">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent"><emph rendition="b i">Hey </emph>there, guys!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent">My name's Trent! This is Jessica!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Hi you guys! Let us know if you need anything, okay?</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="2"></cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="3">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout"><emph rendition="b i">Girl!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">I got this one, guys.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="4">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Hi! Can I</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout"><emph rendition="i">Guess who was just in a battle? </emph>Don't bother guessin', 'cause it was me! See this blood? I got <emph rendition="b i">no </emph>idea whose it is! Not <emph rendition="b i">mine, </emph>anyway! Yeah-ha! Well, most of it. The blood comin' out of my head's mine. You got any wireless headsets you could show me?</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">We, uh... have one right there!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="5">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">Ah.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">You mean this one...</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout"><emph rendition="i">Here?</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:caption type="audio">Flex</cbml:caption>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="6">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">Nnf</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="audio">Admit one gun show</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
        </div>
        
        <div type="page" n="3">            
            <cbml:panel n="1">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">I... don't know what's happening right now.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Are you flexing?</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">What? <emph rendition="b i">Nngh! </emph>No.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="thought" who="Scout"><emph rendition="i">Must... flex... harder.</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:caption subtype="audio">Painful flex</cbml:caption>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="2">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">I was just... <emph rendition="b i">rrg! </emph>Casually pointing at this headset.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout">This is my... <emph rendition="b i">rngf! </emph>Natural pointing stance.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Oh. Okay. Anyway, that's it there. You found it.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Scout"><emph rendition="b i">Yeah </emph>i did.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="thought" who="Scout">Heh. Ol' flexy. Never fails.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="3">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent">...and the bullets biodegrade once they hit flesh,  leaving nothing behind but a blog post.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Heavy">Bullet will <emph rendition="b">update </emph>blog with kill count?</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="4">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent">In real <emph rendition="i">time, </emph>sir!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Heavy">I do not have blog.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent">The bullets are programmed to set one up for you!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Heavy">I <emph rendition="b i">like </emph>this gun.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="5">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier"><emph rendition="b i">Judases!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">I have used this Mann co. shovel for thelve years!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">It does not blog! It does not biodegrade! <emph rendition="i">It barely digs holes!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:caption subtype="audio">Foom!</cbml:caption>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="6">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">But it is mine and aggggh it is on fire!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="7">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Trent">Uh oh! Let me take care of that for you sir!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Bah! This shovel bursts into flame so often my hand is a fireproof mass of scar tissue!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">You hippies have nothing that I need!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
        </div>
        
        <div type="page" n="4">            
            <cbml:panel n="1">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">You'll like this, sir.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">I will not! Keep pushing me, sister, and I will plant my carbon footprint so far us your <emph rendition="b i">is that a pig?</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Yep! You just plug it into the firewire port.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="2">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Is that pig <emph rendition="b i">cooking?</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Already cooked! Who wants bacon, ribs, pork chops and ham?</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Soldier">Yes, yes, I do, and yes.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale"><emph rendition="b i">Stop...</emph></cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="3">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale"><emph rendition="b i">...Right there!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:caption subtype="audio">Property damage</cbml:caption>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="4">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">The name's Saxton Hale! Australian! CEO of Mann co! And the man who's gonna <emph rendition="b i">burn this place to the ground!</emph></cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="5">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">I make square, <emph rendition="i">unsafe products for men! </emph>Not White little egg things with no sharp edges and only <emph rendition="i">one button!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">Look at this thing! It's not on fire! How do you even know it's <emph rendition="b i">on?</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:caption subtype="audio">Brave press!</cbml:caption>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="6">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale"><emph rendition="b i">Ha! </emph>Mysterious button, you just got pressed by <emph rendition="b i">Saxton Hale!</emph></cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Newscaster">This just in! Someone has blown up the moon!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="7">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">Enh?</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="8">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">That's our <emph rendition="b">newest </emph>product. The Iblewupthemoon.</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">Are you saying... I just...?</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Jessica">Yep!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">Well, <emph rendition="b i">that </emph>is fantastic.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="9">
                <cbml:caption subtype="sudio">A bold new plan!</cbml:caption>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale">Let me see your manager. Because I am buying your company.</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            
            <cbml:panel n="10">
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Manager"><emph rendition="b i">No sale, </emph>Hale!</cbml:balloon>
                <cbml:balloon type="speech" who="Saxton_Hale"><emph rendition="b i">You! </emph>I should have known! This place has your curvy stink all over it!</cbml:balloon>
            </cbml:panel>
            <cbml:indicia>Next issue!</cbml:indicia>
            <cbml:indicia>When titans clash!</cbml:indicia>
        </div>
    </body>
</text>
</TEI>